mandates/committee.yaml follows the mandate format of ai-hedge-fund's hedge_fund/fund/example.yaml (MIT).
Design ideas (no code copied): google/adk-recipes financial-advisor sample (Apache-2.0),
kweinmeister/agentic-trading (Apache-2.0), HKUDS/Vibe-Trading (MIT).

Trading laws (gemini_tradingagents/laws.py, paper.py): ideas only, no code copied, from
- voyager67/JaneStreet-Agentic-Skills (Apache-2.0): pre-trade checks, fail closed, frozen limits.
- EnriqueKhai/JaneStreetETC22 (BSD-3-Clause): one order per symbol and side.
- RasmusCodes/figgie-bot (MIT): never pay more than the expected value.
- scaomath/kaggle-jane-street and evgeniavolkova/kagglejanestreet (no license given; ideas only): purged
  walk-forward with an embargo.
Quotes from Jane Street's public materials and from Agustin Lebron's The Laws of Trading (Wiley, 2019) are short
citations for attribution. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Jane Street.
